{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object approached, take it and check its properties. If not, move towards it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
